This repository is derived from StreamBench, which is also distributed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0:

  StreamBench: Towards Benchmarking Continuous Improvement of Language Agents
  Cheng-Kuang Wu, Zhi Rui Tam, Chieh-Yen Lin, Yun-Nung Chen, Hung-yi Lee
  https://github.com/stream-bench/stream-bench
  https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.08747

The benchmark environments (stream_bench/benchmarks), the LLM backends
(stream_bench/llms), the evaluation pipeline (stream_bench/pipelines) and the
Zero-shot / Self-Refine / Self-StreamICL / MemPrompt agents come from that
project, with modifications. The DRPG framework itself
(stream_bench/agents/policy.py, policy_rag.py, utils_rag.py) and the
Dynamic Cheatsheet baseline (stream_bench/agents/dynamic_cheatsheet.py) were
added by the DRPG authors.

Dynamic Cheatsheet is a reimplementation, for the no-feedback ablation, of:

  Dynamic Cheatsheet: Test-Time Learning with Adaptive Memory
  Mirac Suzgun et al., https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.07952

The benchmark datasets (Spider, CoSQL, BIRD, HotpotQA, DDXPlus, DS-1000) are
distributed by their original authors under their own licenses; this repository
only downloads them.
